WEBVTT

00:08:27.636 --> 00:08:32.156
Third, as we stop using fossil fuels,

00:08:32.156 --> 00:08:33.756
some of our communities,

00:08:33.796 --> 00:08:36.676
their livelihoods
are going to be left behind.

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:38.596
Those jobs are going to evaporate.

00:08:38.956 --> 00:08:43.676
And so we've got to guarantee
that the good-paying jobs

00:08:43.716 --> 00:08:47.156
of the new clean economy
are available to them.

00:08:47.916 --> 00:08:51.316
LL: I want to finish
by asking you about leadership.

00:08:51.356 --> 00:08:55.876
So you say that the book is written
for the leader inside us?

00:08:55.916 --> 00:08:57.236
What's your call to action?

00:08:57.236 --> 00:08:59.036
We have leaders sitting in the room,

00:08:59.036 --> 00:09:00.396
we have leaders listening.